<title>UK: SBC launches warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>SBC launches warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, on Roche DC, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 500 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    14000 CHF		 PREMIUM	18.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.60 CHF		  GEARING	7.41 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  13350 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
